            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Patch top-level flags (``has_no_medications``, ``has_no_therapies``,\n``not_attending_school``) on the questionnaire; 404 if not found.\n\nOnly the provider the questionnaire was sent to may update it (403 otherwise). Only\nfields present in the request body are updated; omitted fields are unchanged."
        },
